abstract = {As the rapid advancement of artificial intelligence (AI) technology, its applications across various industries continue to expand. In the education sector, AI-empowered educational reform is being vigorously pursued. This study focuses on application models of AI-empowered teaching, exploring methodological approaches for AI-enhanced instruction. Specifically, using data structure course as an example, it studies AI-empowered teaching methods which include Intelligent learning assistance, Intelligent teaching assistance, Intelligent guided experimentation, Intelligent grading and AI-driven assessment. These AI-empowered pedagogical approaches were designed, implemented, and applied in real teaching. Practical verification demonstrates that AI-enhanced teaching not only improves instructional effectiveness but also significantly alleviates teachers' workload. Furthermore, it provides personalized learning environments that foster students' competency development.},
